description:
Design a clock gating circuit that generates an enable clock signal. The output ENCLK will pass the CLK signal when the enable (EN) input is high; otherwise, it outputs a LOW signal. Additionally, the circuit incorporates a transparent latch (controlled by EN and TE) to provide temporary data storage capabilities, allowing for controlled synchronization of the clock signal with the enable condition.
module top_module(
  input CLK, EN, TE,
  output reg ENCLK
);

code:
module top_module(
  input CLK, EN, TE,
  output reg ENCLK
);always @(*) begin
    if (EN) 
      ENCLK = CLK;
    else 
      ENCLK = 1'b0;
  end

endmodule

