description:
Design a logic gate that functions as a combinational circuit with a specific output condition. The module takes five logic inputs (A1, A2, B1, C1, D1) and four power and ground signals (VPWR, VGND, VPB, VNB). It outputs a HIGH signal (Y) only when all five logic inputs are HIGH (1), regardless of the power signals. If not all inputs are HIGH and they do not possess indeterminate states, the output is LOW. If the input is indeterminate, the output is also indeterminate (X). This design effectively acts as a multi-input AND gate with additional power and ground handling.
module top_module(
    input A1, A2, B1, C1, D1, VPWR, VGND, VPB, VNB,
    output Y
);

